{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32149","headline":"达摩支曲 · 温庭筠","name":"达摩支曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捣麝成尘香不灭，拗莲作寸丝难绝。\n红泪文姬洛水春，白头苏武天山雪。\n君不见无愁高纬花漫漫，漳浦宴余清露寒。\n一旦臣僚共囚虏，欲吹羌管先丸澜。\n旧臣头鬓霜华早，可惜雄心醉中老。\n万古春归梦不归，邺城风雨连天草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}